 "at": "2026-11-24T07:38:27.184Z",
 "seconds": 6,
 "body": "<div id=\"w47fs\" class=\"w47fs\" lang=\"da\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://project-4fcxa.vercel.app/store-blog/w47-forsendelse/w47fs.css\">\n<section class=\"fs-hero\">\n<h1 class=\"fs-h1\">The ultimate shipping guide: Turn every order into a Christmas present</h1>\n<p class=\"fs-lead\">Five Christmas looks for the postal box that make unboxing something special. Your customer just has to grab some gift wrapping paper – you’ve already handled the beautiful surprise inside. We’ve packed them, photographed them, and made shopping lists. All you have to do is steal them.</p>\n<nav class=\"fs-pills fs-jump\" aria-label=\"Contents\"><a href=\"#fs-trin\">Five steps</a><a href=\"#fs-looks\">Five looks</a><a href=\"#fs-logo\">Your logo</a><a href=\"#fs-praktisk\">The practical info</a></nav>\n<div class=\"fs-stage\" style=\"background-color:#eedcd6\"><a class=\"fs-shot is-on\" href=\"#look-01\" data-i=\"0\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/27859f34-7186-46da-8a25-f4780cbae971.jpeg\" alt=\"Pink postal box with pink tissue paper, green ribbon, a fir twig, and a candy cane\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\"></a><a class=\"fs-shot\" href=\"#look-02\" data-i=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/76a52fbb-10fb-4f53-8072-194ab500de77.jpeg\" alt=\"Kraft postal box with red tissue paper, tied with green ribbon\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\"></a><a class=\"fs-shot\" href=\"#look-03\" data-i=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/83abbc56-8a93-43d3-99db-94779fe8ecab.jpeg\" alt=\"White postal box with a parcel in tissue paper with gold stars, tied with gold ribbon\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\"></a><a class=\"fs-shot\" href=\"#look-04\" data-i=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/40ad23e0-0aa0-4c9b-873f-da13eb4e296b.jpeg\" alt=\"Flat kraft postal box with a parcel in gift wrapping paper with green branches, tied with gold ribbon\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\"></a><a class=\"fs-shot\" href=\"#look-05\" data-i=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/76fdb6df-2f22-40fb-b09b-3a4d1fe33413.jpeg\" alt=\"Black postal box with black tissue paper, tied with silver ribbon and wooden snowflakes\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\"></a></div>\n<div class=\"fs-pills fs-chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a look\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-chip is-on\" data-i=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f1d3cf 50%,#b8913f 50%)\"></i>Pink & gold</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-chip\" data-i=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b3262a 50%,#1f3a2c 50%)\"></i>Red Christmas</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-chip\" data-i=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffffff 50%,#c9a45f 50%)\"></i>Gold stars</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-chip\" data-i=\"3\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c39b6e 50%,#3d5a43 50%)\"></i>Green branches</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-chip\" data-i=\"4\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1c1c1c 50%,#c9c9c9 50%)\"></i>Black & silver</button></div>\n<p class=\"fs-cap\"><span class=\"fs-cap-n\">Look 01</span><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"#look-01\">See the look<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&darr;</i></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-sec fs-why\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">“It’s just a postal box.”</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-ans\"><b>Not in December.</b></p>\n<ol class=\"fs-cards\">\n<li><span class=\"fs-n\">01</span><h3 class=\"fs-h3s\">The gift experience starts as soon as the lid is opened.</h3><p>In December, many orders are Christmas gifts. With tissue paper, ribbon, and little festive details, you can turn the contents into an experience itself. Your customer just needs to wrap the postal box – then it’s ready to go under the tree.</p></li>\n<li><span class=\"fs-n\">02</span><h3 class=\"fs-h3s\">Whoever gets the gift sees your name.</h3><p>If your logo is on the postal box, the recipient knows where the gift was bought before it’s unwrapped. And the recipient can become your next customer.</p></li>\n<li><span class=\"fs-n\">03</span><h3 class=\"fs-h3s\">Fold, place inside, insert, fold over, tie.</h3><p>That’s the whole trick. We’ve just written it down – with pictures.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-sec fs-steps\" id=\"fs-trin\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">Step by step</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-said\">“I won’t have time to wrap everything nicely in December.”</p>\n<p class=\"fs-ans\"><b>Yes, you will. Five steps – and the hardest part is the bow.</b></p>\n<p class=\"fs-lead\">The steps are the same for all five looks. See them with Pink & gold or Gold stars:</p>\n<div class=\"fs-pills fs-seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Show steps with\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"is-on\" data-set=\"r\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Pink & gold</button><button type=\"button\" data-set=\"w\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Gold stars</button></div>\n<div class=\"fs-stepper\">\n<div class=\"fs-sstage\" aria-live=\"polite\"><img class=\"fs-si is-on\" data-set=\"r\" data-i=\"0\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/4fbb0760-12fe-4428-8308-947fe0aae2fd.jpeg\" alt=\"An open pink postal box with pink tissue paper, a fir twig, and two gold jewellery boxes beside it\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"r\" data-i=\"1\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/860694d9-219f-457f-83d4-67b4077e62a6.jpeg\" alt=\"Pink tissue paper in the pink postal box, hanging over the edge\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"r\" data-i=\"2\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/198dfc3f-38ea-42cc-b5fe-33292c9a794a.jpeg\" alt=\"Two gold jewellery boxes in the tissue paper\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"r\" data-i=\"3\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/6f1bf026-98b7-4025-80d6-874df4dce715.jpeg\" alt=\"The tissue paper is folded over with a fir twig and a candy cane on top\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"r\" data-i=\"4\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/68b94e64-de75-4822-bf51-7ff6199e268e.jpeg\" alt=\"The finished pink postal box with green ribbon, fir twigs, a candy cane, and a gold jewellery box beside it\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"w\" data-i=\"0\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/abd34187-1fb0-4d5d-a0bc-3e4e6b3ed4b2.jpeg\" alt=\"An open white postal box with tissue paper with gold stars, ribbon, and jewellery boxes in front\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"w\" data-i=\"1\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/9b192017-7ddb-4e22-ad13-343b016225ca.jpeg\" alt=\"Tissue paper with gold stars in the white postal box, hanging over the edge\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"w\" data-i=\"2\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/cff62c29-6301-46a5-8c15-90f69086d5c2.jpeg\" alt=\"Two cream-colored jewellery boxes in the gold star tissue paper\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"w\" data-i=\"3\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/e8b1b8a3-9c3a-45ff-8f1e-10fdbef258ad.jpeg\" alt=\"Wooden stars and a white twig placed on top of the jewellery boxes, ready for the tissue paper to be folded over\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"fs-si\" data-set=\"w\" data-i=\"4\" src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/a64fe9b0-6c02-4412-bb3a-afbd453d7f7b.jpeg\" alt=\"The finished parcel with gold-colored ribbon and wooden stars in the white postal box\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<div class=\"fs-prog\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"is-on\"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n<div class=\"fs-sctl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-prev\" aria-label=\"Previous step\">&larr;</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-play\" aria-label=\"Play steps\"><b class=\"fs-pl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></b><span>Play</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-next\" aria-label=\"Next step\">&rarr;</button></div>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"fs-sl\"><li class=\"fs-step is-on\" data-i=\"0\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-sh\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"fs-sn\">01</span><span class=\"fs-stt\">Fold the postal box.</span></button>\n<div class=\"fs-sb\"><figure class=\"fs-sfig\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/4fbb0760-12fe-4428-8308-947fe0aae2fd.jpeg\" alt=\"An open pink postal box with pink tissue paper, a fir branch, and two gold-colored jewellery boxes beside it\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p data-r-t=\"@@C0@@\">Fold the bottom of the postal box and prepare the lid.</p><p class=\"fs-tip\"><b>Tip:</b> Start by folding along all score lines before assembling. It makes the process easier.</p><a class=\"fs-ar fs-swap\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310341.html\" data-r-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310341.html\" data-w-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/standard-postal-box-w-tape-closure-medium-32371310301.html\" data-r-t=\"@@C1@@\" data-w-t=\"@@C2@@\"><span>See the pink postal box</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></li>\n<li class=\"fs-step\" data-i=\"1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-sh\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"fs-sn\">02</span><span class=\"fs-stt\">Add ribbon and tissue paper.</span></button>\n<div class=\"fs-sb\"><figure class=\"fs-sfig\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/860694d9-219f-457f-83d4-67b4077e62a6.jpeg\" alt=\"Pink tissue paper in the pink postal box, hanging over the edge\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p data-r-t=\"@@C3@@\">First, place the ribbon at the bottom of the postal box so the ends stick out over the sides. Fold the tissue paper to fit the width of the postal box and lay it in the bottom of the box on top of the ribbon.</p><p class=\"fs-tip\"><b>Tip:</b> Make sure the ribbon goes well over the edges so there’s enough for a bow – it makes step 5 easier.</p><a class=\"fs-ar fs-swap\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721101340.html\" data-r-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721101340.html\" data-w-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721400000.html\" data-r-t=\"@@C4@@\" data-w-t=\"@@C5@@\"><span>See the tissue paper</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></li>\n<li class=\"fs-step\" data-i=\"2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-sh\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"fs-sn\">03</span><span class=\"fs-stt\">In go the jewellery boxes.</span></button>\n<div class=\"fs-sb\"><figure class=\"fs-sfig\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/198dfc3f-38ea-42cc-b5fe-33292c9a794a.jpeg\" alt=\"Two gold-colored jewellery boxes in the tissue paper\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p data-r-t=\"@@C6@@\">Place them in the center of the paper, with the logo facing up – it's your business card inside the parcel.</p><p class=\"fs-tip\"><b>Tip:</b> Are the boxes loose? Crumple up an extra sheet next to them so nothing rattles in transit.</p><a class=\"fs-ar fs-swap\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/boston-eco-jewellery-box-drop-earrings-pendant-30280040022.html\" data-r-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/boston-eco-jewellery-box-drop-earrings-pendant-30280040022.html\" data-w-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/santorini-eco-jewellery-box-large-pendant-bangle-30290060352.html\" data-r-t=\"@@C7@@\" data-w-t=\"@@C8@@\"><span><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Boston ECO</span> – free logo print</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></li>\n<li class=\"fs-step\" data-i=\"3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-sh\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"fs-sn\">04</span><span class=\"fs-stt\">Fold the tissue paper over.</span></button>\n<div class=\"fs-sb\"><figure class=\"fs-sfig\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/6f1bf026-98b7-4025-80d6-874df4dce715.jpeg\" alt=\"The paper folded over with a fir sprig and a candy cane on top\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p data-w-t=\"@@C9@@\" data-r-t=\"@@C10@@\">Place a fir sprig and a candy cane on top – or a wooden star from us.</p><p class=\"fs-tip\"><b>Tip:</b> Decorations can come from the garden or kitchen drawer – just make sure they look intentionally placed.</p><a class=\"fs-ar fs-swap\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/wooden-stars-on-rustic-string-36-pcs-02341490020.html\" data-r-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/wooden-stars-on-rustic-string-36-pcs-02341490020.html\" data-w-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/wooden-stars-on-rustic-string-36-pcs-02341490020.html\" data-r-t=\"@@C11@@\" data-w-t=\"@@C12@@\"><span>See the wooden stars</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></li>\n<li class=\"fs-step\" data-i=\"4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-sh\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"fs-sn\">05</span><span class=\"fs-stt\">Tie the bow. Close the lid.</span></button>\n<div class=\"fs-sb\"><figure class=\"fs-sfig\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/68b94e64-de75-4822-bf51-7ff6199e268e.jpeg\" alt=\"The finished pink postal box with green ribbon, fir branches, a candy cane, and a gold-colored jewellery box beside it\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p data-r-t=\"@@C13@@\">Take the ends of the ribbon up over the paper, tie a bow, and close the lid. Now it’s not just an order – it’s a Christmas gift.</p><p class=\"fs-tip\"><b>Tip:</b> Tie the bow inside the postal box – not around it. That way, the lid can close over the bow.</p><a class=\"fs-ar fs-swap\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750680.html\" data-r-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750680.html\" data-w-h=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750020.html\" data-r-t=\"@@C14@@\" data-w-t=\"@@C15@@\"><span>See the green satin ribbon</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></li></ol>\n</div>\n<p class=\"fs-after\"><a class=\"fs-ar fs-tolist\" data-r-h=\"#look-01\" data-w-h=\"#look-03\" data-r-t=\"@@C16@@\" data-w-t=\"@@C17@@\" href=\"#look-01\">Full shopping list for Pink & gold<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&darr;</i></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-sec fs-looks\" id=\"fs-looks\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">Five looks</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-ans\"><b>Pick a look. Or steal all five.</b></p>\n<p class=\"fs-lead\">Each look comes with a shopping list – click straight through to each item.</p>\n<article class=\"fs-look\" id=\"look-01\">\n<h3 class=\"fs-h2\">Look 01: Pink & gold</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-ltx\">Pink on the outside, gold inside, and a green bow on top. That’s the style we’re wrapping in the steps above – Christmas, but lighter.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-mos\"><a class=\"fs-m1\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310341.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/27859f34-7186-46da-8a25-f4780cbae971.jpeg\" alt=\"Pink postal box with pink tissue paper, green ribbon, a fir sprig, and a candy cane\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m2\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/boston-eco-jewellery-box-drop-earrings-pendant-30280040022.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/9ff551e4-612b-41c1-bf1e-7c420517b018.jpeg\" alt=\"Fir sprig, candy cane, and green ribbon on pink tissue paper\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m3\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721101340.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/5bd9846c-2257-4d68-9d17-0a8081a97457.jpeg\" alt=\"Two gold jewelry boxes next to pink tissue paper and a fir sprig\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n<h4 class=\"fs-need\">What you’ll need</h4>\n<ul class=\"fs-list\"><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310341.html\">Pink postal box&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721101340.html\">Pink tissue paper&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750680.html\">Green satin ribbon with glitter&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/boston-eco-jewellery-box-drop-earrings-pendant-30280040022.html\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Boston ECO</span> jewelry box, gold&nbsp;&rarr;</a> <span class=\"fs-free\">Free logo print</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"fs-lcta\"><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310341.html\">See the postal box</a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"fs-look\" id=\"look-02\">\n<h3 class=\"fs-h2\">Look 02: Red Christmas</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-ltx\">Kraft on the outside, Christmas red inside – with a polishing cloth included so the jewelry shines on Christmas Eve.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-mos\"><a class=\"fs-m1\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-176x116x64-mm-32372300581.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/76a52fbb-10fb-4f53-8072-194ab500de77.jpeg\" alt=\"Kraft postal box with red tissue paper, tied with green ribbon\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m2\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/melbourne-eco-jewellery-box-for-ring-necklace-pen-30360060682.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/b065dcb5-3ff5-4e3a-a9ae-134b17a692e0.jpeg\" alt=\"A round dark green jewelry box in red tissue paper, with a Christmas card and red berries\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m3\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721110400.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/c25bf9b3-4054-4c1e-846d-eea36b81106d.jpeg\" alt=\"Kraft postal box, red tissue paper, green ribbon, and a round dark green jewelry box on display\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n<h4 class=\"fs-need\">What you’ll need</h4>\n<ul class=\"fs-list\"><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-176x116x64-mm-32372300581.html\">Kraft postal box&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721110400.html\">Red tissue paper&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750680.html\">Green satin ribbon with glitter&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/melbourne-eco-jewellery-box-for-ring-necklace-pen-30360060682.html\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Melbourne ECO</span> jewelry box, dark green&nbsp;&rarr;</a> <span class=\"fs-free\">Free logo print</span></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/wtp-rpet-jewellery-polishing-cloth-32260010000.html\">Jewelry polishing cloth&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li></ul>\n<p class=\"fs-lcta\"><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-176x116x64-mm-32372300581.html\">See the postal box</a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"fs-look\" id=\"look-03\">\n<h3 class=\"fs-h2\">Look 03: Gold stars</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-ltx\">White, gold, and stars everywhere. Even the smallest jewelry box looks like a big present.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-mos\"><a class=\"fs-m1\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/standard-postal-box-w-tape-closure-medium-32371310301.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/83abbc56-8a93-43d3-99db-94779fe8ecab.jpeg\" alt=\"White postal box with a parcel wrapped in gold star tissue paper, tied with gold ribbon\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m2\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/santorini-eco-jewellery-box-large-pendant-bangle-30290060352.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/57ea42ab-ba0f-46cf-90e3-01f0309048d3.jpeg\" alt=\"Two cream-colored jewelry boxes and a wooden star on gold star tissue paper\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m3\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721400000.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/f3b7c63e-5e66-46d7-9fa7-3fc094db1cb7.jpeg\" alt=\"White postal box, gold star tissue paper, gold ribbon, jewelry boxes, and a wooden star on display\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n<h4 class=\"fs-need\">What you’ll need</h4>\n<ul class=\"fs-list\"><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/standard-postal-box-w-tape-closure-medium-32371310301.html\">White postal box with tape closure&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721400000.html\">Gold star tissue paper&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750020.html\">Gold satin ribbon with glitter&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/wooden-stars-on-rustic-string-36-pcs-02341490020.html\">Wooden stars on string&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/santorini-eco-jewellery-box-large-pendant-bangle-30290060352.html\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Santorini ECO</span> jewelry box, cream&nbsp;&rarr;</a> <span class=\"fs-free\">Free logo print</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"fs-note\">The text inside the lid is our own example of digital print. That's where your logo can go.</p>\n<p class=\"fs-lcta\"><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/standard-postal-box-w-tape-closure-medium-32371310301.html\">See the postal box</a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"fs-look\" id=\"look-04\">\n<h3 class=\"fs-h2\">Look 04: Green branches</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-ltx\">Kraft, green branches, and a wooden reindeer – Nordic Christmas, made to open. Here we've taken it a step further: All materials in the postal box can be used to wrap it beautifully, so your customer has everything needed to make the parcel ready for under the tree.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-mos\"><a class=\"fs-m1\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-166x125x30-mm-32372320581.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/40ad23e0-0aa0-4c9b-873f-da13eb4e296b.jpeg\" alt=\"Flat kraft postal box with a parcel wrapped in green branch gift wrapping paper, tied with gold ribbon\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m2\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-wrapping-paper-n-2821-33328210200.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/a8968eba-5d7b-4a11-813c-926a0288a931.jpeg\" alt=\"The flat postal box wrapped in green branch paper, tied with gold ribbon, with a round gold gift tag and a wooden reindeer\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m3\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-wrapping-paper-n-2821-33328210200.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/acfc2cc6-89bd-40cb-a38e-8614fee3b7dc.jpeg\" alt=\"Flat kraft postal box, green branch gift paper, ribbon, a jewellery box, a jewellery pouch, and a wooden reindeer ready to use\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n<h4 class=\"fs-need\">What you'll need</h4>\n<ul class=\"fs-list\"><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-166x125x30-mm-32372320581.html\">Flat kraft postal box&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-wrapping-paper-n-2821-33328210200.html\">Gift wrapping paper with green branches&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750020.html\">Gold satin ribbon with glitter&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/wooden-deer-on-rustic-string-24-pcs-02341500000.html\">Wooden reindeer with string&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/gift-enclosure-cards-for-christmas-100-pcs-round-02460140020.html\">Round gold gift tags&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/seoul-eco-jewellery-box-for-bangle-30230061602.html\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Seoul ECO</span> jewellery box, dusty green&nbsp;&rarr;</a> <span class=\"fs-free\">Free logo print</span></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/faux-suede-jewellery-pouch-large-00293060811.html\">Jewellery pouch in faux suede&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li></ul>\n<p class=\"fs-note\">The gold trees on the jewellery box are a pre-made Christmas design. Choose it in the logo module when you order your box.</p>\n<p class=\"fs-lcta\"><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-166x125x30-mm-32372320581.html\">See the postal box</a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"fs-look\" id=\"look-05\">\n<h3 class=\"fs-h2\">Look 05: Black & silver</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-ltx\">Black on black, silver on top. It looks expensive.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-mos\"><a class=\"fs-m1\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310101.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/76fdb6df-2f22-40fb-b09b-3a4d1fe33413.jpeg\" alt=\"Black postal box with black tissue paper, tied with silver ribbon and a wooden snowflake\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m2\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/vienna-jewellery-box-for-ring-stud-earrings-00320000102.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/476aeb0c-0a38-44f2-8544-aa3d56128275.jpeg\" alt=\"Black tissue paper with silver ribbon and a wooden snowflake\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a class=\"fs-m3\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721150100.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/02cc4d28-002c-4459-8308-2b379487968b.jpeg\" alt=\"Black postal box, black tissue paper, silver ribbon, and black jewellery boxes ready to use\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n<h4 class=\"fs-need\">What you'll need</h4>\n<ul class=\"fs-list\"><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310101.html\">Black postal box&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721150100.html\">Black tissue paper with glitter&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/satin-ribbon-narrow-02342430030.html\">Silver satin ribbon&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/wooden-snowflake-36-pcs-02352110000.html\">Wooden snowflake, metallic silver&nbsp;&rarr;</a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/vienna-jewellery-box-for-ring-stud-earrings-00320000102.html\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Vienna</span> jewellery box, matt black&nbsp;&rarr;</a> <span class=\"fs-free\">Free logo print</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"fs-lcta\"><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310101.html\">See the postal box</a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"fs-look fs-mix\" id=\"look-06\">\n<h3 class=\"fs-h2\">Look 06: Mix your own</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-ltx\">Take the postal box from one look and the ribbon from another. Pink box, black paper, gold ribbon? Go for it.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-mx\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"fs-mc\"><a class=\"fs-mo is-on\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310341.html\" data-l=\"1\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/36dd9f9c-c01d-4692-ad10-df447a511ab1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Pink postal box</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/standard-postal-box-w-tape-closure-medium-32371310301.html\" data-l=\"3\" data-m=\"022b2aac-ed50-4869-948e-f51ecf05ef8a\"><span>White postal box</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-236x181x54-mm-32372310101.html\" data-l=\"5\" data-m=\"787d20e3-cec8-4802-aea7-d35949ea36c0\"><span>Black postal box</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/postal-box-176x116x64-mm-32372300581.html\" data-l=\"2\" data-m=\"491a5659-4a98-412f-8542-9906e1746a63\"><span>Kraft postal box</span></a></div><div class=\"fs-mc\"><a class=\"fs-mo is-on\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721150100.html\" data-l=\"5\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/d08a79b7-284c-4459-bb2d-22d1d30880bb.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Black tissue paper</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721101340.html\" data-l=\"1\" data-m=\"6d23ccb3-6b79-440a-ab73-27909eb3f19f\"><span>Pink tissue paper</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721110400.html\" data-l=\"2\" data-m=\"3030b102-28b2-4891-ad11-39a4b86859af\"><span>Red tissue paper</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-tissue-paper-chloride-acid-free-32721400000.html\" data-l=\"3\" data-m=\"2178afaf-2506-469e-99e5-b45a8b499234\"><span>Tissue paper with gold stars</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/fscr-certified-wrapping-paper-n-2821-33328210200.html\" data-l=\"4\" data-m=\"1f736407-5a25-414b-a76a-953ebb2b16f5\"><span>Gift wrapping paper with green branches</span></a></div><div class=\"fs-mc\"><a class=\"fs-mo is-on\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750020.html\" data-l=\"34\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/9ab25453-874b-4dc3-8422-e1438038817f.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Gold satin ribbon</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/narrow-satin-ribbon-with-glitter-02353750680.html\" data-l=\"12\" data-m=\"51136f98-6974-4da9-a595-96fcc8780ded\"><span>Green satin ribbon</span></a><a class=\"fs-mo\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/satin-ribbon-narrow-02342430030.html\" data-l=\"5\" data-m=\"3f15dbaf-f080-4b17-b47e-9e0448810f24\"><span>Silver satin ribbon</span></a></div><i aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i><i aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i></div>\n<div class=\"fs-btns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fs-shuf\">Mix again</button><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\">See all postal boxes</a></div>\n<p class=\"fs-more\"><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/blog/9-inspirational-christmas-packaging-sets\">More inspiration: 9 Christmas packaging sets<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></p>\n</article>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-sec fs-andet\" id=\"fs-andet\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">Not just for jewelry</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-said\">“Postal boxes? But we don’t sell jewelry.”</p>\n<p class=\"fs-ans\"><b>Neither does the postal box.</b></p>\n<p class=\"fs-lead\">Candles, scarves, creams, ceramics – wrap it in tissue paper and tie a ribbon around it. It’s the same five steps and the same Christmas gift when the lid comes off.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-tiles\"><figure><div class=\"fs-anim\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 240\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><defs><clipPath id=\"fsclip\"><rect width=\"240\" height=\"204\"/></clipPath></defs><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"206\" rx=\"96\" ry=\"6\" fill=\"#24211d\" opacity=\".08\"/><g class=\"fs-bx\"><path d=\"M48 62h144l10 62H38z\" fill=\"#dcc09a\"/><path d=\"M50 55h140l2 7H48z\" fill=\"#c29a6c\"/><path d=\"M38 124h164v22H38z\" fill=\"#97734e\"/><path d=\"M42 146c10-26 30-14 44-22s28 10 38 2 28-14 40-4 22 12 32 24z\" fill=\"#f1d3cf\"/></g><g clip-path=\"url(#fsclip)\"><g class=\"fs-it\" style=\"--i:0\"><g transform=\"matrix(1.5 0 0 1.5 -60 -77)\"><path d=\"M100 104a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h28a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v48h-40z\" fill=\"#efe6d8\"/><rect x=\"104\" y=\"103\" width=\"32\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e2d2b8\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"117\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3d33\"/><rect x=\"111\" y=\"125\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#e8c79f\"/>