\"fs-it\" style=\"--i:5\"><g transform=\"matrix(1.5 0 0 1.5 -60 -77)\"><g transform=\"rotate(-10 120 128)\"><rect x=\"117.5\" y=\"108\" width=\"5\" height=\"48\" rx=\"2.5\" fill=\"#b9bdc0\"/><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"94\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"17\" fill=\"#d3d6d8\"/><ellipse cx=\"116\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"4\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#eef0f1\"/></g></g></g><g class=\"fs-it\" style=\"--i:6\"><g transform=\"matrix(1.5 0 0 1.5 -60 -77)\"><rect x=\"101\" y=\"124\" width=\"38\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b8913f\"/><rect x=\"99\" y=\"114\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c9a45f\"/><rect x=\"118\" y=\"114\" width=\"4\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#2f3d33\"/><ellipse cx=\"113\" cy=\"111\" rx=\"7\" ry=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2f3d33\"/><ellipse cx=\"127\" cy=\"111\" rx=\"7\" ry=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2f3d33\"/></g></g></g><g class=\"fs-bx\"><path d=\"M38 146c26-8 40 4 82-4s58 2 82 4v6H38z\" fill=\"#e8c2bc\"/><rect x=\"36\" y=\"146\" width=\"168\" height=\"58\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c79e6f\"/><rect x=\"36\" y=\"146\" width=\"168\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#d5b083\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"176\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#b8913f\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"176\" r=\"7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2ca92\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></g></svg></div><figcaption class=\"fs-cn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"--i:0\">A scented candle.</span><span style=\"--i:1\">A scarf.</span><span style=\"--i:2\">A face cream.</span><span style=\"--i:3\">A mug.</span><span style=\"--i:4\">Sunglasses.</span><span style=\"--i:5\">A christening spoon.</span><span style=\"--i:6\">And yes – jewelry.</span></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/115a2746-16c4-4fd7-9d48-6414d8135b12.jpeg\" alt=\"Black postal box with FILLED WITH LOVE … and other cool stuff in gold foil on the lid\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>That’s exactly what the lid says.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p class=\"fs-note\"><b>Measure the height first.</b> The postal boxes range from 2.2 to 12.8 cm in height – and up to 40 cm in length.</p>\n<p class=\"fs-more\"><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\">Find the right size<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-sec fs-logo\" id=\"fs-logo\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">Logo on your postal box</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-said\">“Logo on the postal box? That’s only for the big brands.”</p>\n<p class=\"fs-ans\"><b>From 200 pcs. That’s all it takes to look like one.</b></p>\n<p class=\"fs-lead\">Foil outside on the lid, digital print inside – or both. So your customer sees your name before the box is open – and again when it is.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-ph\"><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/e015a19e-da7c-4554-850d-974524348edc.jpeg\" alt=\"Kraft postal box with a gold foil logo on the lid\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Gold foil outside</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/ce64d7d4-2f65-43f5-ab58-6f483a1a5faf.jpeg\" alt=\"Open postal box with a logo printed inside the lid\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Digital print inside the lid</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/c481805c-d05a-43f3-b3ec-f095506dcfc9.jpeg\" alt=\"Closed kraft postal box with a large black logo on the lid\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Black foil on kraft</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\"><img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/a931f2ef-259d-44da-808d-133fd62cd3ab.jpeg\" alt=\"Postal boxes with logo both outside and inside the lid\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\"><span>Inside and out</span></a></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-cards fs-facts\"><li><h3 class=\"fs-h3s\">From 200 pcs.</h3><p>with your logo – the logo costs extra per box</p></li><li><h3 class=\"fs-h3s\">Foil or digital print</h3><p>foiling in gold, silver, copper and more colors on the outside, digital print inside</p></li><li><h3 class=\"fs-h3s\">8–9 working days</h3><p>in production with a new logo – 5–6 when you reorder with the same</p></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-btns\"><a class=\"fs-btn\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\">View postal boxes</a></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-sec fs-faq\" id=\"fs-praktisk\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">All the practical details</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-ans\">Seven answers before you order.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-qa\"><details id=\"faq-postaeske\" open><summary><span>Which postal box should I choose?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>Start with what you’re shipping: choose a postal box with room for your products and the paper around them. The internal measurements are shown on each product page.</p><p>Kraft, pink, and black close without tape. The white one has a tape closure. All five are natural brown inside, so it’s the paper that adds the color.</p><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\">View all postal boxes<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></details><details id=\"faq-antal\"><summary><span>How many should I buy – and where should I store them?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>Without a logo, you order postal boxes in packs of 50. They’re delivered flat and unassembled, so they take up minimal space in storage – and you fold them by hand without tools.</p></div></details><details id=\"faq-logo\"><summary><span>Can I have my logo on the postal box?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>Yes – foil on the outside of the lid, digital print on the inside, or both. This costs extra per box, and with logo you order from 200 pieces. If you want your logo in gold, silver or white, choose foil – digital print cannot do that.</p><p>Production takes 5–6 working days when you reorder with the same logo, and 8–9 working days with a new logo.</p></div></details><details id=\"faq-gratis\"><summary><span>Is logo print on jewellery boxes really free?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>Yes – all five jewellery boxes in the looks include free logo print: <span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Boston ECO</span>, <span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Melbourne ECO</span>, <span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Santorini ECO</span>, <span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Seoul ECO</span> and <span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Vienna</span>. On your first order you pay neither setup nor cliché charges.</p><p>Would you like a Christmas design on the lid? Choose a ready-made Christmas motif in the logo module.</p><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/blog/christmas-logoprint\">See the Christmas motifs<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></details><details id=\"faq-silkepapir\"><summary><span>Can I get tissue paper and ribbon with logo?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>Yes, but not for this Christmas. With a new logo, production time is 6–7 weeks, and tissue paper with logo is ordered from 5,000 sheets.</p><p>This year, pack with in-stock paper and ribbon – and next Christmas, your logo can be on everything.</p></div></details><details id=\"faq-proeve\"><summary><span>Can I get a sample first?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>Yes – of postal boxes and jewellery boxes, also with your logo. Samples are not free: you pay for shipping and a small fee per sample with logo.</p></div></details><details id=\"faq-frister\"><summary><span>When should I order for Christmas?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"fs-qa-a\"><p>If you want a logo, the answer is: now. Without logo, processing time is 1 working day. Deadlines differ from country to country, so check your own.</p><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/blog/christmas-delivery--opening-hours-2026\">See the deadlines for your country<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></div></details></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"fs-close\">\n<h2 class=\"fs-h2\">Stock up – before the Christmas rush empties your shelves.</h2>\n<p class=\"fs-lead\">Postal boxes, paper, ribbon and decorations. Order before the rush of orders – not during it. The first recommended deadlines for orders with print fall as early as 10 December – and they differ from country to country.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-btns\"><a class=\"fs-btn is-light\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/shipment-products/postal-boxes.html\">View all postal boxes</a></div>\n<p class=\"fs-links\"><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/blog/christmas-delivery--opening-hours-2026\">See the deadlines for your country<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a><a class=\"fs-ar\" href=\"/dkk_dk_den/sales/order/history/\">Reorder your regular items<i aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</i></a></p>\n</section>\n<script src=\"https://project-4fcxa.vercel.app/store-blog/w47-forsendelse/w47fs.js\"></script>\n<div hidden data-carrier><p data-c=\"0\">Fold the bottom of the postal box and prepare the lid.</p><p data-c=\"1\">View the pink postal box</p><p data-c=\"2\">View the white postal box</p><p data-c=\"3\">First, place the ribbon in the bottom of the postal box, so the ends hang out over the edges. Fold the tissue paper to fit the width of the box and lay it in the bottom on top of the ribbon.</p><p data-c=\"4\">View the tissue paper</p><p data-c=\"5\">View the tissue paper with stars</p><p data-c=\"6\">In the center of the paper, with the logo facing up – this is your business card in the package.</p><p data-c=\"7\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Boston ECO</span> – free logo print</p><p data-c=\"8\"><span translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\">Santorini ECO</span> – free logo print</p><p data-c=\"9\">Place a couple of wooden stars on top, fold the paper over – and you're almost there.</p><p data-c=\"10\">Add a sprig of fir and a candy cane on top – or a wooden star from us.</p><p data-c=\"11\">See the wooden stars</p><p data-c=\"12\">See the wooden stars</p><p data-c=\"13\">Take the ends of the ribbon over the paper, tie a bow, and close the lid. Now it's not an order anymore – it's a Christmas present.</p><p data-c=\"14\">See the green satin ribbon</p><p data-c=\"15\">See the gold-colored ribbon</p><p data-c=\"16\">Full shopping list for Pink & gold</p><p data-c=\"17\">Full shopping list for Gold stars</p><p data-f=\"title\">The ultimate shipping guide: 5 Christmas looks for the postal box</p><p data-f=\"short\">Five Christmas looks for the postal box, five steps to pack them – and all the practical info on logo print, samples and deadlines.</p><p data-f=\"metaTitle\">The ultimate shipping guide: 5 Christmas looks for the postal box | Westpack</p><p data-f=\"metaDesc\">Five Christmas looks for the postal box with step by step, shopping lists, and everything practical about logo print, samples, and Christmas deadlines.</p></div>\n</div>\n",
 "edited": "production times 7-8/4-5 -> 8-9/5-6 (6defebb)"
